    version: "1.0"
    publisher:
      name: "KeenForgeAI"
    doi: "10.57967/hf/10527"
    notes: >-
      Derived from Gan et al. (2025), doi:10.1038/s41597-025-05980-z. Curated by
      Lu Gan and Sam Li.

  - type: dataset
    title: >-
      raccoon-corrected: a fully re-annotated release of the Raccoon detection
      dataset
    authors:
